    "The MPR has initiated a verification process for the nominees, with a scheduled parliamentary vote set for December 11, 2026."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "President Prabowo Subianto has officially proposed Sugiono and Andi Amran Sulaiman as candidates for the vice presidency to replace Gibran. During the submission process, the President emphasized that his selection was based on the candidates' track records of achievement, service, and loyalty. Following the receipt of these names, the MPR began a formal verification process to evaluate the nominees. Ahmad Muzani, the Chair of the MPR, accompanied the President during the submission at the legislative complex. Officials noted that this procedure is part of the established political and legal framework, which remains active despite recent national challenges. The two candidates will now undergo a vetting process by an MPR-appointed team, with the final parliamentary vote to determine the new vice president currently scheduled to take place on December 11, 2026.",
